      "text": [
        "A small studio that only builds for small businesses",
        "Doman Digital started in 2018 with a simple observation: small businesses were being sold websites they couldn't maintain, then left to fend for themselves once the invoice was paid.",
        "We do things differently. Every site we build comes with a monthly plan, so hosting, security and updates are simply taken care of — and if something breaks or needs changing, you speak to the same small team every time, not a support ticket queue.",
        "We're based in Sheffield and work with businesses across the whole of the UK, from local trades and salons to independent shops and consultants.",
        "Doman Digital studio, Sheffield"
      ]
    },
